WEBVTT

00:22:57.913 --> 00:23:01.454
And there's a part of me that thinks, OK,
you're you're activating a new mindset.

00:23:01.579 --> 00:23:03.496
It's we're going into WWE.

00:23:03.746 --> 00:23:05.788
Let's get ready to rumble.

00:23:08.079 --> 00:23:11.913
And I can't wait this this could be fun,
but there's a part of me that also thinks,

00:23:12.121 --> 00:23:15.704
oh, do you do you actually do you ruminate
even more going into them

00:23:15.704 --> 00:23:18.121
thinking, oh, God, I've got to rumble.
This is going to be horrible.

00:23:18.329 --> 00:23:19.413
Does the framing help or hurt?

00:23:19.829 --> 00:23:22.496
It depends. I think it depends on the
culture. Right. And it's funny.

00:23:22.496 --> 00:23:24.579
And this is the age difference
maybe because I've got

00:23:24.621 --> 00:23:26.163
I think I've probably got a decade on you.

00:23:26.163 --> 00:23:30.579
And so when I think of rumble, I think
of West Side Story, I think musicals,